{
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "application_type": "Householder",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The property would not be suitable for subdivision into separate units, failing to meet the minimum floor area threshold, provide an acceptable family unit at ground floor level, have regard to internal and external space standards or provide a good standard of accommodation for occupiers. Accordingly, the application is unacceptable in principle contrary to Local Plan policy SC6.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal would fail to provide an acceptable quality of accommodation for future occupiers contrary to London Plan policy D6, the Nationally Described Space Standards and Local Plan Policy SC5 and SC6.",
    "Reason : 3 - Without evidence to the contrary, the proposal would result in harm to the safety and efficiency of the local transport network, an overprovision of off-street parking and an inadequate level of secure cycle storage contrary to London Plan policies T4, T5, T6 and T6.1, Local Plan policy EC2 and the council's residential and off-street parking policy.",
    "Reason : 4 - In the absence of submitted evidence, the development has failed to demonstrate that it would maximise energy savings at each step of the energy hierarchy, and provide adequate refuse and recycling provisions. It would run contrary to London Plan Policies SI2, Local Plan Policies EQ1 and EQ2 and, EQ7."
  ],
